EVERYAILAW CORPUS — CROSSWALK REFERENCES ONLY

As of v0.3.1, the example records under examples/ no longer bear
https://everyailaw.com/ identifiers. Each example record now carries a
neutral https://obligationfirst.org/ @id and is a self-contained teaching
construct. Where an example corresponds to a real adopter entity, it
references EveryAILaw (and other adopters) only as a crosswalk — via a
sameAs or anchors property pointing at the adopter's own published IRI.
